usage-warp-setting-api-key = Warp API 密钥（wk-…）。在 Warp 中打开个人资料菜单，然后进入 Settings → Platform → API Keys 创建一个。参见 https://docs.warp.dev/reference/cli/api-keys。

usage-warp-credits = 额度
usage-warp-add-on-credits = 附加额度
usage-warp-monthly-credits = 每月额度
usage-warp-unlimited = 无限制
usage-warp-used-of = { $used } / { $limit }
usage-warp-next-add-on-expiry = 附加额度下次到期
usage-warp-credits-on = { $credits ->
       *[other] { $date } 到期 { $count } 额度
    }
